==Trivia==
*Sunset's Howl might be a reference to ''[[wikipedia:Taiyō ni Hoero!|Taiyō ni Hoero]]'', a long-running detective drama whose name can be translated as "Howl at the Sun!"
*This stage is complementary to [[Berserkory]]'s description ("the ''sunset'' on his back awoke his dark powers").

